      "side": 1,
      "message": "Looking at this again, I\u0027m having second thoughts on this being the only if check.  Spec-wise, we should report an error if we received a message with no transmit.  Would it be possible here to verify the transmit was successful before transitioning?  The TX_COMPLETE flag hasn\u0027t set yet, but is there another check we could make to distinguish this case from a true error?",
